            $k('How many reports failed this month?', 'how many failed, count fail reports, failed this month, number of fail, fail count', 'Open the Lab Tracker, filter by the date and look at the Result column (FAIL in red). The tracker has no ready-made monthly count; ask an administrator for a report from the database if you need totals.', [], $dtr + $goTr),
