            $k('What is the result of a Lab Ref?', 'result of lab ref, did it pass, lab ref result, check result lab ref, what result', 'Ask me "find <Lab Ref No.>": I answer with its type, result and style and a button to open it. The Lab Tracker also shows the result column.', [], $dtr),
