            $k('The Lab Tracker shows a report twice', 'tracker duplicate row, report twice, double entry tracker, same lab ref twice', 'Two records were saved with the same Lab Ref No. Open both, keep the right one, and ask an administrator to remove the other.', [], $dtr),
            $k('How do I open a report from the assistant?', 'open report from assistant, ask bot to open, assistant open lab ref, open dtp', 'Type "open" and the Lab Ref No., for example "open DTP20261012FAA8-L". I show a button that opens the record; add "pdf" or "preview" to get a print preview button as well.', [], []),
